  -> Đã gọi tool: banking.transfer({"from_account_id": "acc_802", "beneficiary_id": "ben_50", "amount": 2500000, "note": "Tiền hàng"}) => Kết quả: {"ok": true, "transaction": {"id": "tx_02", "account_id": "acc_802", "beneficiary_id": "ben_50", "amount": -2500000, "note": "Tiền hàng"}, "balance": 20700000}
